description:
Run PS script on each of the domain controllers to set the services account as a honey account. 

Dev

Get-ADUser -Identity "CN=Service_Tnb_adminH_D,OU=Service,OU=Restricted,OU=Users,OU=Department,DC=…" -Properties * | Set-ADUser -PasswordNeverExpires $true -CannotChangePassword $true -ChangePasswordAtLogon $false -Replace @{ "logonHours" = [System.Array]::CreateInstance([byte], 21); "adminCount" = 1; "servicePrincipalName" = "MSSQLSvc/" + [guid]::NewGuid() + ".Dev.construction.enet" }

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Preprod

CN=Service_Tnb_adminH_P,OU=Service,OU=Restricted,OU=Users,OU=Department,DC=pprod,DC=construction,DC=enet

Get-ADUser -Identity "CN=Service_Tnb_adminH_P,OU=Service,OU=Restricted,OU=Users,OU=Department,DC=pprod,DC=construction,DC=enet" -Properties * | Set-ADUser -PasswordNeverExpires $true -CannotChangePassword $true -ChangePasswordAtLogon $false -Replace @{ "logonHours" = [System.Array]::CreateInstance([byte], 21); "adminCount" = 1; "servicePrincipalName" = "MSSQLSvc/" + [guid]::NewGuid() + ".Pprod.construction.enet" }

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
